/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

## Quarto leftovers from an interrupted render
*.rmarkdown

## The project's full peak set, re-exported by several scripts (~18 MB each) --
## identical every time and derivable from the ArchR project. The differential-peak
## BEDs beside it are small and stay tracked.
**/beds/peak_set.bed

## Peak-to-gene link BEDs -- 3.4 GB across 10 groups x 6 correlation cutoffs,
## regenerated by peaks2geneslinks.qmd. Not tracked pre-hybrid either.
peaks2geneslinks*/

## HOMER output from peaks.qmd -- 46 MB of per-motif SVG/HTML/.motif files across
## five k-means clusters. `knownResults.txt` is the result table and stays tracked;
## everything else is HOMER's own working output and is regenerated by re-running
## the cluster (delete its directory to force that).
**/homer_kmeans/*/homerResults/
**/homer_kmeans/*/knownResults/
**/homer_kmeans/*/*.html
**/homer_kmeans/*/*.motif*
**/homer_kmeans/*/*.tsv

## chromvar.qmd's cached glut-subset ArchR project -- its own copy of the Arrow
## files, so the deviations are computed once and never written back into the
## shared project. Regenerated by deleting it and re-rendering.
**/proj_glut_sub/
